** Construct \(\mathcal U_g\) by defining its action on the creation operators as the
single‑particle unitary \(D(g)\) together with the momentum map \(T_g\), and extend it to
the whole Fock space; its matrix elements in the occupation‑number basis are  

\[
(\mathcal U_g)_{\mathbf n,\mathbf n'}
 =(-1)^{N}\prod_{q,\beta}
   \big[\delta_{0,n'_{q\beta}}\delta_{0,n_{T_g q,\beta}}
        +\delta_{1,n'_{q\beta}}\delta_{1,n_{T_g q,\beta}}\big].
\]
